    "data": {
      "id": 2138,
      "hub_id": 2837,
      "guid": null,
      "name": "SamSWAT Optics Port",
      "slug": "samswat-optics-port",
      "teaser": "A complete rework and remaster of SamSWAT's optics",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2837.png",
      "downloads": 7386,
      "favourites_count": 2,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Introduction</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Hey guys,</p>\n<p>I took at look at SamSWAT’s old sights made for versions past, and I thought maybe I could bring them back.</p>\n<p>So here is a completely rebuilt and rebundled version of most of his optics mods. I rebuilt these myself from source models, using all of the same texture values, magnification values, and build structure as the originals but updated with new scripts, new reticle tweaks in some cases, and some specific tweaks to the scripting to make the optics look better.</p>\n<p>Other than very small things they should look and work exactly like the original mods.</p>\n<p>This mod omits the Leupold LCO and D-Evo because they are already in my main mod, <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1764-epic-s-all-in-one/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Epic’s All in One</a></p>\n<p>Enjoy!</p>\n<p><strong>KNOWN ISSUES:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>None at the moment</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Items Included</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>This mod includes the following items:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PK-AS (Both dovetail and rail mounted)</li>\n<li>C79A2 (Both black and green)</li>\n<li>Holosun HS507C (Both red reticle and green reticle)</li>\n<li>Susat sight</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/N8YSJ0K/Sam-SWAT-Overview.png\" alt=\"Sam-SWAT-Overview.png\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How To Install and Compatibility</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>How to install:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the latest release from the google drive</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded zip file with your choice of archive manager (I use WinRAR)</li>\n<li>Put the contents of the zip file into your SPT folder</li>\n<li>Enjoy!</li>\n</ol>\n<p>The standard way to troubleshoot this mod is as follows:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>If you have issues when you install this mod, try making a new profile (preferably a dev bear profile) and make sure your game works. I do this by standard with my mod prior to release anyways, so it should always work.</li>\n<li>Add your previously used mods and boot the game and run a raid after each installed mod. This is to see if anything is conflicting with my mod. Tell me what is conflicting and what your error message is so that I can verify whether it can be fixed or if it just needs to be added to incompatibilities.</li>\n<li>IF YOU HAVE “MISSING PACKAGE JSON” ERROR YOU INSTALLED IT WRONG</li>\n<li>If you are using something that is already listed as an incompatibility I am not going to help you.</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Image Gallery</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/vv3H07Ys/Sam-SWAT-5.png\" alt=\"Sam-SWAT-5.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/8ghC91gw/Sam-SWAT-3.png\" alt=\"Sam-SWAT-3.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/35GnFg86/Sam-SWAT-4.png\" alt=\"Sam-SWAT-4.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LXsZy6sy/Sam-Swat-2.png\" alt=\"Sam-Swat-2.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nMMgSwCr/Sam-SWAT-1.png\" alt=\"Sam-SWAT-1.png\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">sth doesnt work</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Most likely:</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QDMFooZ.gif\" alt=\"QDMFooZ.gif\" /></p>\n<p><strong>But you can always drop your error into the comments.</strong></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-6\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Many thanks to GrooveypenguinX who not only provided the codebase but directly helped me clean up my mod from the way it used to be. (Horrible mess, really)</p>\n<p>Thank you to Tron for being a constant resource in brainstorming and troubleshooting as I continue to grow.</p>\n<p>Moxopixel for being a wealth of knowledge in the texturing department, I could not have done half of this without seeing what you’ve done.</p>\n<p>Thank you SSH for providing an SDK to streamline the process of creating items.</p>\n<p>Credit to SamSWAT for sourcing these models originally from games like Insurgency Sandstorm and Squad as well as artists such as Akinaro.</p>\n<p>Check out the WTT server <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.gg/hKRbR6yvf2\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here.</a></p>\n<p>Support me on Ko-Fi <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/epicrangetime\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here.</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
